# Omenpath Journey {3}{G}: cast on turn 1 with three Moxen and a Forest. Its enters ability searches Bot1's library (Plains x3, Island x2, Swamp, Mountain,
# Wastes, Snow-Covered Plains, four Memnites): two lands of one name (Plains; Plains), a non-land (Memnite) and six names at once are all refused; five
# different names (Plains, Island, Swamp, Mountain, Wastes) are exiled and the library shuffled once (Bot2's is not). At Bot1's end step one of the exiled lands
# is chosen at random and put onto the battlefield tapped: four cards stay in exile and a Swamp is on the battlefield tapped (the random pick is the
# corpus's fixed seed). Turn 3's end step puts a second, so three stay in exile and seven permanents are on the battlefield.

